    "description": "tx header for frostbite"
  },
  "frostbiteTx": "● Go to a warm and dry place\n● Do not rub the affected skin, as it is very delicate\n● Do not soak the affected skin in very hot water ♨️❌, as this will hurt it \n● You can soak your skin in room temperature water, unless the skin is already wet (in that case, it needs to air dry)\n● As your skin rewarms, it might hurt — this is normal. The affected skin might look red and swollen",
  "@frostbiteTx": {
    "description": "tx for frostbite"
  },
  "frostbiteWarning": "As you warm up the affected skin, it should go back to its normal color and appearance. If you see no improvement after a few hours, seek medical attention immediately",
  "@frostbiteWarning": {
    "description": "frostbite warnings"
  },
