  "infectionPreventionHeader": "Preventing wound infections",
  "@infectionPreventionHeader": {
    "description": "Header for infection prevention"
  },
  "infectionPrevention": "● Keep wounds clean and covered with a clean bandage\n● Change bandages daily or when they become soiled\n● Wash your hands with soap and water before and after changing a bandage 🧼\n● Avoid touching your wounds",
  "@infectionPrevention": {
    "description": "infection prevention list"
  },
  "infectionPreventionNote": "If you have diabetes, poor circulation, a weakened immune system or other health conditions, you may be at higher risk for skin infections. Always seek medical care to help with your wound care",
